  2012 was the European sovereign debt crisis (Greece, Spain, Italy). Treasuries were
  the global safe haven.

  THE CRITICAL EVENT:
  2012-03-30 signal: TLT had Faber z=-1.42 (recent weak 10m momentum since the Dec 2011
  bond rally faded). QQQ had z=+1.52 (equity momentum was strong Feb-Mar 2012).
  Gap = z_QQQ - z_TLT = 1.52 - (-1.42) = 2.938z.

  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  AT 2.75z threshold: gap=2.938 > 2.75 → ALLOWS SWAP → same as 2z         │
  │  AT 3.00z threshold: gap=2.938 < 3.00 → BLOCKS SWAP → keeps TLT          │
  │                                                                            │
  │  The entire 2.75z → 3.0z Sharpe jump (+0.10 Sharpe live-only) is driven  │
  │  by this single event where gap=2.938 sits 0.062z below the 3.0 line.    │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  What happened next (May 2012 — European debt crisis peak):
