      → 3z KEPT TLT despite its very negative z-score — correct (COVID hit Feb 2020)

  REGIME TRANSITION PATTERN: All triggers occur when:
    - A SAFE HAVEN (TLT or GLD) is being displaced by a RISK ASSET
    - The evidence gap is MODERATE: risk asset is better, but not by enough to be certain
    - The REGIME CHANGE HAS NOT FULLY MATERIALIZED when the signal fires

